

        N.U.S  -   New User System

        Written by Air Strike Software Development Group

        Copyright 1996

        This is a new user message door, for Maxs BBS.

        Please Note : Use At Your Own Risk.

        Installation :

                 1 .. Create a Directory called NUS in your
                      Doors Directory.

                 2 .. Copy the Executable file NUS to that
                      Directory.

                 3 .. Upgrade the Config file.
                      as to say the Sysops Name.

                 4 .. Update your Doors:guestdoor.text file
                      with the following line
                      nus/nus

        Program Notes :

        This Version is the first Release of this program.

        Update Info :

        All updates of this door can be obtained from
